---
id: cucumber-campari-greek-yogurt-salad
title: Creamy Greek Yogurt Cucumber & Campari Salad
category: fresh_salad_veg

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 342

storage:
  fridge_days: 1
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Slice @mini-cucumbers{2%cucumber} into thin half-moons and quarter @campari-tomatoes{3%tomato}. Add both to a mixing bowl.

Spoon @greek-yogurt-2pct{2%tbsp} over the vegetables and toss gently to coat evenly.

Season with @kosher-salt{0.25%tsp}, @black-pepper{0.25%tsp}, and @dried-dill{0.25%tsp}. Toss once more and serve immediately.
